      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "Additional info. This occurs when:\n1. VRC_WebPanel \"Is Interactive\" is enabled.\n2. Web content has text input fields.\n3. Player clicks some text input.\nAfter that,\n1. Player can't move mouse pointer.\n2. Player can't move by WASD keys. (I used desktop mode client)\n3. Player can't show quick menu by ESC key.\n4. Player can activate text input view again.\n\nIt seems that input focus is locked in Web browser.\nI think the only way to escape is to shutdown the VRChat client.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
